村ゆみ","detail":"主題歌 「ココロノ」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:84715","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"川村 ゆみ","creatorId":"vndb:s1724","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1724","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1724","name":"川村 ゆみ","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:20877","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"KeN","creatorId":"vndb:s4623","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4623","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4623","name":"米川 賢一","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:20880","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"陽光","creatorId":"vndb:s8334","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8334","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8334","name":"陽光","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:20882","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"スタジオポッド","creatorId":"vndb:s19061","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19061","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19061","name":"株式会社スタジオポッド","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:20884","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"茶飲","creatorId":"vndb:s7283","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7283","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7283","name":"茶飲 一服","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:20885","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c29983","characterName":"鴨居 由真","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["18001"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29983"},"originalCharacterName":"鴨居 由真","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Protagonist's childhood friend who often does domestic chores in his house. They've known each other since kindergarten. She's a bit unfriendly towards strangers, but soft to childhood friends Ryouta and Makoto. Still, there is something more to her personality than meets the eye."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29983"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【家事万能な幼馴染みはモンスター？】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良太の家でその家事の腕をふるう家事万能な良太の幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"付き合いは一番古く、幼稚園以来一緒である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し無愛想で、突拍子も無い所があるが、基本的に良太と誠には甘い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"■ヤンデレ設定"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヤンデレとしては典型的なモンスタータイプのヤンデレ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"対象のことが好きで好きでしょうがない、だから、過剰な行動を取りがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、長い長い時間その状態で居た為、もはやその状態がデフォルトであり、彼女にとっては病んでいる状態こそが常態なのだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18001","sourceWorkId":"10954","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a26809d1ff169bb55eb56fb4c05e8df61d6a4371225494ffe5eab392dd59d64.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/142620e5071b2209ae319c70c4a8a9ffba7cc05a74f36c2514fa3538221a5e85.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"逢川 奈々","creatorId":"vndb:s530","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s530","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s530","name":"逢川奈々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:10560","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29984","characterName":"城田 美紀","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"51218","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"38024"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18002"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29984"},"originalCharacterName":"城田 美紀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【明るい場所は苦手。日光は嫌い。人はもっと嫌です。】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先天性で疾患したアルビノの少女。その為か、初夏だというのに常に長袖を着ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人との触れ合いを極端に嫌い、人の居ない場所を良く好む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、その体質故か日光が苦手であり、常に日陰に居ると言っても過言ではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"■ヤンデレ設定"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヤンデレとしては典型的な人を遠ざけるたがるタイプ。ツンデレが極度に高まったケース。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その心の奥底には自身のアルビノへのコンプレックスと、他人から裏切られる恐怖が常に付きまとっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"裏切られたくないから、裏切られないように傷つける。二律背信的なキャラ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18002","sourceWorkId":"10954","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"患有先天性白化病的少女。因此，虽然已经时值初夏，但是还是常常穿着长袖衣服。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"讨厌和人交往，喜欢呆在没有其他人的地方。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而且，因为自己的这种病，不能够照射阳光，而常常待在阴暗的地方。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良太对其的评价是“那双血红的眼睛给人难以磨灭的印象”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“没办法见太阳。讨厌阳光。也讨厌其他人。”"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"51218"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69c19be9bf8e5a388f6a951507f0d36babd89e365889c62e2f7ce6f92339e47d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a8f3814847b33c74b85e16f26ec162ca9ac2f4bf6d693b9ddfd16b09c498601.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"Ageha","creatorId":"vndb:s3231","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3231","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3231","name":"Ageha","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:10561","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29985","characterName":"神代 裕子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"51216","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"38024"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18003"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29985"},"originalCharacterName":"神代 裕子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【部活の先輩はお嬢様？　いつもニコニコ笑ってる。】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神代食品という会社のご令嬢。何気にお嬢様であるが、本人はジャンクフードなどを好んで食べている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも穏やかで、常に笑っているという印象が強く、良太にとっては心のオアシス的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"■ヤンデレ設定"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヤンデレとしては一見大人しいタイプ。直接的な行動が起こらなければ、ただの一般人である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、相手と結ばれ、相手が自分のことを見てくれないと病み始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相手の注意を引くために何でもしてしまう自損亜種タイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、実家がかなりの規模の会社である、と言うことから学園内でも浮いた存在として扱われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そう言った状況が生み出した結果が、一種の甘えとなり、行きすぎて病んでしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18003","sourceWorkId":"10954","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神代食品公司的大小姐。让人费解的是，虽然身为大小姐，但是她却十分喜欢吃那些毫无营养的食品。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是给人一副笑容可掬的稳重印象，对于良太来说，就是心中的那块绿洲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"演艺部的部长，在如果没有两个部员就会废部的情况下，还继续致力于研究舞台剧的责任感十分强烈的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良太谓之曰“每当迷惘之时，有她在身边相伴，就会安定下来”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“是吗？我喜欢你？”"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"51216"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a2284a8597574b56f4123faf7a735eb3c4f683c3ab338a4472fb3d3af39a91f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cdea435ec0e8b9e04e9e835ef78be8dda878df0387c68e6b20304ca4cd8573d7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中茉理花","creatorId":"vndb:s2571","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2571","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2571","name":"田中 茉理花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:38024:51216:15994:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29993","characterName":"畠 静子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"65559","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"38024"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18004"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29993"},"originalCharacterName":"畠 静子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【女神のような先生は、彼から見れば、なんかヘビー】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良太・由真・誠のクラスの担任。若くて、溌剌としてることからも学園では人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思ったことはストレートパンチの様に言ったり、また罰則が非常に子供じみていながらも与えられる"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"威圧感は他の教師の比では無い、という事にはクラスの誰もが首を縦に振るとか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"■ヤンデレ設定"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「君はやれば出来る子だよ」……と言われて血のにじむような努力をした過去がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その結果「できなかった」ため、それがトラウマとなる。後の努力でその失敗は挽回する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、その為に「やれば出来る、出来ない子はやってない」という間違った観念を持ってしまい、「出来ない＝努力不足」、ならば努力が到達するまでやらせる、という歪んだ精神構造となったヤンデレ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18004","sourceWorkId":"10954","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"良太・由真・誠的班主任。年轻，阳光的形象在学园中有着极高的人气。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有话直说的性格，责罚非常的孩子气。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"威严感是其他教师所无法比拟的，在班里说句话，完全无人敢违抗。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良太的评价是“虽然很漂亮，不过怎么说呢，比较难对付……有点可怕”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“你对于干坏事这种行径有何异议吗？”"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"65559"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/453dd7193cc5d1d75cf1458d4dfee5110f15eff616d8aef72253b3bc8048d814.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16297dc14bb053ff2e0a699ac29569fdc0a6f028919d7e0efc9eb93a561aae8d.webp","width":130,"height":180,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ひなたたまり","creatorId":"vndb:s7515","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7515","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7515","name":"星 もえる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:38024:65559:20814:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29994","characterName":"相田 誠","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"51215","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"38024"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18005"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29994"},"originalCharacterName":"相田 誠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryouta and Yuma's childhood friend who is bright and cheerful, and always laughing. He is also known as the moodmaker of the trio."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29994"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【一部の人間が先走るくらい女顔の男の子】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"顔で有名でもある主人公の親友。明るく陽気で、いつも笑ってる事が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、食欲が旺盛であり、その体からは考えられないほどよく食べる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼馴染み三人の中でもムードメーカー的な存在であり、交友関係はかなり広い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18005","sourceWorkId":"10954","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"长相很女生气的主角的好朋友。开朗阳光，总是面带笑容。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食欲十分旺盛，有着和其体型不成正比的惊人食量。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"青梅竹马三人行中的气氛制造机，交际面也是非常的广泛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良太曰“小动物系的人。兔子吗？还很难说……”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“我，我是男生……良太……（可恶）”"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"51215"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be3f6f2af4323cc51722883c0773b106f4e685644da08bf2d6d4f458be5bc877.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/3649db3d894444d8ff42160ef61b5abcc0c0d6033638c682d97a5c204903104c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:38024:51215:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c82203","characterName":"荻 良太","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c82203"},"originalCharacterName":"荻 良太","